00:33:42.960 --> 00:33:44.300
Yeah, through.

00:33:44.300 --> 00:33:45.140
Basically,

00:33:45.140 --> 00:33:46.760
it's like a reward function.

00:33:46.760 --> 00:33:49.840
And so you allow the model to
